/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/tests/test_w175_v018_analytic_diagnostic.py:144:        "initial_world_sha256": "world",
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:176:The first component is energy-efficiency stratification. At each step, the catfish side produces one complete transition bundle containing all users and the three-dimensional reward, denoted $\tau_t^{F}$. Define its stratification score as the mean unshaped additive contribution to the first objective before calibration:
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:180:第一個部分是能效分層。鯰魚代理在每一步產生一筆包含全體使用者和三維獎勵的完整轉移束 $\tau_t^{F}$。令分層分數為該步校準前、未整形第一目標的平均可加貢獻：
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:185:\mathrm{routing}\!\left(\tau_t^{F}\right)=
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:200:Fig. 4-4: Energy-efficiency stratification. The catfish-side transition bundle $\tau_t^{F}$ is scored by its mean unshaped first-objective contribution $g^{F}\!\left(t,\boldsymbol{\theta},\theta_{3dB}\right)$ before calibration and compared with the recent distribution $F_W$. High-scoring bundles enter $D_{F}$, middle-scoring bundles are also sent to $D_M$, and low-scoring bundles are discarded (Eq. (4.7)), each retained buffer then uses its corresponding calibrated reward view.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:307:| 5 | &nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,Execute the main-agent action to obtain $\tau_t^M$, calibrate its unshaped reward, and store the complete transition in $D_M$. |
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:308:| 6 | &nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,Execute the catfish-agent action to obtain $\tau_t^{F}$, evaluate the main-agent greedy action from the same pre-action state and form the competitive reward using Eq. (4.11). |
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-retrain-ws/.scratch/chinese-word-v023-lcsrs-20260905-r2/en/bilingual/bi-ch4-method.md:309:| 7 | &nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,&nbsp,Route $\tau_t^{F}$ using its uncalibrated first objective in Eq. (4.7). Samples sent to $D_M$ use the unshaped calibrated view, catfish TD updates use the shaped calibrated view. |
